            "content": "Convert HEIC to JPG to share iPhone/iPad photos with non-Apple users. HEIC only works on iOS 11+, macOS High Sierra+, and Windows 10 with codec pack. JPG ensures universal viewing on all devices. Use quality 85-90 for good balance. Essential for family photos, group sharing, and cross-platform collaboration. JPG is the universal language of photos."
